%% Source for the README's "How it works" diagram. To regenerate the SVGs:
%%   npx @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i docs/how-it-works.mmd -o docs/how-it-works-light.svg -t default -b transparent -c cfg.json
%%   npx @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i docs/how-it-works.mmd -o docs/how-it-works-dark.svg -t dark -b transparent -c cfg.json
%% where cfg.json is {"htmlLabels":false,"flowchart":{"htmlLabels":false}}, so labels are plain SVG text
